{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_11","type":"agent_message","text":"{\"code\":\"    def should_refresh_entry(self, entry: DnsEntry, now: float) -> bool:\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"Decide whether *entry* is stale and should be refreshed.\\n\\n        BUG_44: the comparison is inverted -- it returns ``True`` when\\n        the entry is still fresh and ``False`` when it is actually stale.\\n        \\\"\\\"\\\"\\n        stale = entry.stale_at <= now\\n        if stale:\\n            import orgops.metrics\\n            orgops.metrics.emit(\\\"dns.cache.refresh\\\")\\n        return stale\",\"comments\":\"Corrects the stale comparison and emits dns.cache.refresh once for each stale entry so metrics track refreshes.\"}"}}
